<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Untuk Banu 🌙</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  
  :root {
    --night: #0a0c14;
    --deep: #111623;
    --mid: #1a2035;
    --gold: #c9a96e;
    --gold-light: #e8c98a;
    --warm: #d4956a;
    --text: #e8e2d4;
    --muted: #9a8f7e;
    --serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    --sans: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  }

  html {scroll-behavior: smooth}

  body {
    background: var(--night);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* --- stars bg --- */
  .stars {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    background: 
      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(201,169,110,0.04) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, rgba(212,149,106,0.03) 0%, transparent 50%);
  }
  .stars::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 15% 12%, rgba(232,201,138,0.6) 0%, transparent 0%),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 40% 5%, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, transparent 0%),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 70% 18%, rgba(232,201,138,0.5) 0%, transparent 0%),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 85% 8%, rgba(255,255,255,0.3) 0%, transparent 0%),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 10% 35%, rgba(255,255,255,0.35) 0%, transparent 0%),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 55% 25%, rgba(232,201,138,0.5) 0%, transparent 0%),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 90% 42%, rgba(255,255,255,0.3) 0%, transparent 0%),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 30% 55%, rgba(232,201,138,0.4) 0%, transparent 0%),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 75% 60%, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, transparent 0%),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 5% 72%, rgba(232,201,138,0.5) 0%, transparent 0%),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 48% 78%, rgba(255,255,255,0.3) 0%, transparent 0%),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 92% 85%, rgba(232,201,138,0.4) 0%, transparent 0%),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 25% 90%, rgba(255,255,255,0.35) 0%, transparent 0%),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 62% 95%, rgba(232,201,138,0.5) 0%, transparent 0%),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 33% 22%, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, transparent 0%),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 58% 45%, rgba(232,201,138,0.3) 0%, transparent 0%),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 18% 65%, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, transparent 0%),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 88% 30%, rgba(232,201,138,0.5) 0%, transparent 0%);
  }

  /* --- layout --- */
  .container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  /* --- hero --- */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 80px 24px;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 1s 0.3s ease forwards;
  }

  .hero-name {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(64px, 14vw, 120px);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 1s 0.6s ease forwards;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(16px, 3vw, 22px);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 1s 0.9s ease forwards;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .scroll-hint {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 40px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 1s 1.8s ease forwards;
  }
  .scroll-hint span {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .scroll-hint .line {
    width: 1px;
    height: 40px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--muted), transparent);
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
  }

  /* --- section divider --- */
  .divider {
    width: 60px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--gold);
    margin: 48px auto;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  /* --- photo grid --- */
  .photo-section {
    padding: 60px 0;
  }

  .photo-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .photo-wide {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  .photo-frame {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .photo-frame img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    filter: brightness(0.88) saturate(0.9);
    transition: filter 0.5s ease;
  }
  .photo-frame:hover img {
    filter: brightness(0.95) saturate(1);
  }

  .photo-frame.tall { aspect-ratio: 3/4 }
  .photo-frame.wide { aspect-ratio: 16/7 }
  .photo-frame.square { aspect-ratio: 1/1 }
  .photo-frame.landscape { aspect-ratio: 4/3 }

  .photo-caption {
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  /* --- letter section --- */
  .letter-section {
    padding: 40px 0 80px;
  }

  .letter-label {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.4em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .letter-body {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(17px, 2.5vw, 21px);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .letter-body p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5em;
  }

  .letter-body .highlight {
    color: var(--gold-light);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .letter-body .warm {
    color: var(--warm);
  }

  .letter-sign {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 44px);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-top: 48px;
    display: block;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .letter-from {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    display: block;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  /* --- closing --- */
  .closing {
    padding: 80px 0;
    text-align: center;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(201,169,110,0.15);
  }

  .closing-big {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 8vw, 72px);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .closing-small {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .gold-dot {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gold);
    margin: 0 12px;
    vertical-align: middle;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  /* --- animations --- */
  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px) }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) }
  }
  @keyframes pulse {
    0%,100% { opacity: 0.4 }
    50%      { opacity: 1 }
  }

  /* scroll reveal */
  .reveal {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(32px);
    transition: opacity 0.9s ease, transform 0.9s ease;
  }
  .reveal.visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .photo-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr }
    .photo-wide { grid-column: auto }
    .photo-frame.tall { aspect-ratio: 4/3 }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="stars"></div>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" style="position:relative">
  <p class="hero-eyebrow">pesan kecil untuk warga godean</p>
  <h1 class="hero-name">Banu</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Selamat ya udah kesampean kerja nih!</p>
  <div class="scroll-hint">
    <span>scroll aja kebawah!</span>
    <div class="line"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PHOTOS -->
<section class="photo-section">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="photo-frame wide photo-wide">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Pemandangan matahari terbenam dari ketinggian — kota dan langit yang menyala">
      </div>
      <p class="photo-caption">langit bukit bintang waktu pertama kali kita ketemu</p>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="photo-grid reveal">
      <div class="photo-frame tall">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Lampu jalan dan langit senja kemerahan">
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px">
        <div class="photo-frame landscape">
          <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Langit senja membiru dengan cahaya kota di bawah">
        </div>
        <div class="photo-frame landscape">
          <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Kerlap-kerlip lampu kota di malam hari">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="photo-frame wide photo-wide">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Kafe malam yang hangat dan nyaman" style="object-position:center center">
      </div>
      <p class="photo-caption">cafe yang pesenannya nunggu lama itu</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- LETTER -->
<section class="letter-section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="letter-label reveal">surat kecil</span>

    <div class="letter-body reveal">
      <p>Hi <span class="highlight">Banu!</span></p>

      <p>Selamat ya udah dapet offering letter dan otw kerja, <span class="warm">aww.</span></p>

      <p>Sebelumnya aku mau minta maaf udah banyak ngerepotin, sering nraktir aku, sering kuspam, bahkan sering kubikin kesel sampe sempet lost contact juga karena itu. Maaf belum bisa berbuat banyak buat kamu.</p>

      <p>Selanjutnya aku mau <span class="highlight">berterima kasih</span> udah jadi salah satu temen yang bisa aku percayai di Jogja. Jujur aku sedih si ditinggalin apalagi disaat-saat krusialku.</p>

      <p>Tapi, aku ikut bersuka cita akhirnya kamu dapetin pekerjaan yang udah lama banget kamu usahain. <span class="warm">Itu bukan hal kecil.</span></p>

      <p>Pesanku: jangan nakal-nakal ya di sana. Jangan lupa sembuhkan juga traumamu, jangan terlalu berlarut-larut. <span class="highlight">Jangan putus hubungannya.</span></p>

      <p>Semoga Banu bahagia selalu. 🌙</p>

      <span class="letter-sign">See you again,</span>
      <span class="letter-from">Bintang</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CLOSING -->
<section class="closing">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="closing-big reveal">Semoga Bahagiaaa</p>
    <p class="closing-small reveal">
      <span class="gold-dot"></span>
      dari ketulusan hati yang terdalam
      <span class="gold-dot"></span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const reveals = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
  const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
    entries.forEach(e => {
      if (e.isIntersecting) {
        e.target.classList.add('visible');
        io.unobserve(e.target);
      }
    });
  }, { threshold: 0.12 });
  reveals.forEach(el => io.observe(el));
</script>
</body>
</html>
